#. type: Title ==
#: kicad.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:50
msgid ""
"KiCad is an open-source software suite for creating electronic circuit schematics and printed circuit boards (PCBs).  KiCad supports an integrated design workflow in which a schematic and corresponding PCB are designed together, as well "
"as standalone workflows for special uses.  KiCad also includes several utilities to help with circuit and PCB design, including a PCB calculator for determining electrical properties of circuit structures, a Gerber viewer for inspecting "
"manufacturing files, and an integrated SPICE simulator for inspecting circuit behavior."
msgstr ""
"KiCad 是一款用于创建电子电路原理图和印刷电路板（PCB）的开源软件套件。  KiCad 支持综合设计工作流程，其中原理图和相应的 PCB 一起设计，也支持特殊用途的独立工作流程。  KiCad 还包括一些帮助电路和 PCB 设计的实用程序，包括用于确定电路结构电气属"
"性的 PCB 计算器、用于检查制造文件的 Gerber 浏览器和用于检查电路行为的集成 SPICE 模拟器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:55
msgid ""
"KiCad runs on all major operating systems and a wide range of computer hardware.  It supports PCBs with up to 32 copper layers and is suitable for creating designs of all complexities.  KiCad is developed by a volunteer team of software "
"and electrical engineers around the world with a mission of creating free and open-source electronics design software suitable for professional designers."
msgstr "KiCad 可在所有主要的操作系统和广泛的计算机硬件上运行。  它支持多达 32 个铜层的 PCB，适合创建各种复杂的设计。  KiCad 是由世界各地的软件和电气工程师组成的志愿者团队开发的，其使命是创建适合专业设计师的免费和开源的电子设计软件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:57
msgid "The latest version of this documentation is available at https://docs.kicad.org."
msgstr "该文件的最新版本可在 https://docs.kicad.org 。"

#. type: Title ===
#: kicad.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:63
msgid ""
"KiCad is capable of running on a wide variety of hardware and operating systems, but some tasks may be slower or more difficult on lower-end hardware.  For the best experience, a dedicated graphics card and display with 1920x1080 or "
"higher resolution is recommended."
msgstr "KiCad 能够在多种硬件和操作系统上运行，但在低端硬件上执行某些任务可能会很慢或很困难。为获得最佳体验，建议使用 1920x1080 或更高分辨率的专用显卡和显示器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:66
msgid "Please check the KiCad website for the latest system requirements: https://kicad.org/help/system-requirements/"
msgstr "有关最新的系统要求，请查看 KiCad 网站：https://kicad.org/help/system-requirements/"

#. type: Title ===
#: kicad.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "KiCad files and folders"
msgstr "KiCad 文件和文件夹"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:71
msgid "KiCad creates and uses files with the following specific file extensions (and folders)  for schematic and board editing."
msgstr "KiCad 创建并使用具有以下特定文件扩展名（和文件夹）的文件进行原理图和电路板编辑。"

#. type: Plain text
#: kicad.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Many of these files include important design information, especially the project file (`.kicad_pro`), the schematic file(s) (`.kicad_sch`), and the board file (`.kicad_pcb`). Other files may also be necessary. Such files should always be "
"included when distributing the project. Some files are not necessary to distribute with the project, such as the project-local settings file (`.kicad_prl`) or the `fp-info-cache` file.  Files that are unnecessary to distribute are noted "
"in the table below."
msgstr ""
"这些文件中包含大量重要设计信息，尤其是工程文件 (`.kicad_pro`)、原理图文件 (`.kicad_sch`) 和电路板文件 (`.kicad_pcb`)。其他文件也可能需要包含。在分发工程时，应始终包含这些文件。某些文件无需与工程一起分发，例如工程本地设置文件 "
"(`.kicad_prl`) 或 `fp-info-cache` 文件。无需分发的文件在下方表格中有所标注。"

#. type: Title ====
#: kicad.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project files"
msgstr "工程文件"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_pro`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project file, containing settings that are shared between the schematic and PCB"
msgstr "工程文件，包含在原理图和PCB之间共享的设置"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.pro`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Legacy (KiCad 5.x and earlier) project file.\n"
"      Can be read and will be converted to a `.kicad_pro` file by the project manager."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 5.x 及更早版本）工程文件。可被读取，并将由工程管理器转换为 `.kicad_pro` 文件。"

#. type: Title ====
#: kicad.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic editor files"
msgstr "原理图编辑器文件"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_sch`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic files, containing all symbol and connection information."
msgstr "原理图文件，包含所有符号和连接信息。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_sym`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic symbol library file, containing the symbol descriptions: graphic shape, pins, fields."
msgstr "原理图符号库文件，包含符号描述：图形形状、引脚、字段。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_blocks`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic design block library folders. The folder itself is the library."
msgstr "原理图设计模块库文件夹。该文件夹本身即为库。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_block`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Schematic design block folder for defining a reusable schematic design.\n"
"      The folder is the design block, and contains a `.kicad_sch` file defining\n"
"      the design block's schematic and a `.json` file defining the design\n"
"      block's metadata."
msgstr "用于定义可重用原理图设计的设计块文件夹。该文件夹即为设计块，其中包含一个定义设计块原理图的 `.kicad_sch` 文件和一个定义设计块元数据的 `.json` 文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.wbk`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulator workbook file containing SPICE simulation setup information."
msgstr "模拟器工作簿文件，包含 SPICE 仿真设置信息。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.sch`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Legacy (KiCad 5.x and earlier) schematic file.\n"
"      Can be read and will be converted to a `.kicad_sch` file on write."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 5.x 及更早版本）原理图文件。可读取，并在写入时转换为 `.kicad_sch` 文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.lib`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "Legacy (KiCad 5.x and earlier) schematic library file. Can be read but not written."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 5.x 及更早版本）原理图库文件。可读取但不可写入。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.dcm`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Legacy (KiCad 5.x and earlier) schematic library documentation. Can be read but not written."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 5.x 及更早版本）原理图库文档。可读但不可写。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*-cache.lib`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Legacy (KiCad 5.x and earlier) schematic component library cache file.\n"
"      Required for proper loading of a legacy schematic (`.sch`) file."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 5.x 及更早版本）原理图元件库缓存文件。 用于正确加载旧版原理图（`.sch`）文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "`sym-lib-table`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol library table: list of symbol libraries available in the schematic editor."
msgstr "符号库表：原理图编辑器中可用的符号库列表。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "`design-block-lib-table`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design block library table: list of design block libraries available in the schematic editor."
msgstr "设计模块库列表：在原理图编辑器中可用的设计模块库列表。"

#. type: Title ====
#: kicad.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Board editor files and folders"
msgstr "PCB 编辑器的文件和文件夹"

#. type: Table
