#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.mod`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Legacy (KiCad 4.x and earlier) footprint library file.\n"
"      Can be read by the footprint or the board editor, but not written."
msgstr "旧版（KiCad 4.x 及更早版本）封装库文件。封装或电路板编辑器可以读取该文件，但无法写入。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "`fp-lib-table`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Footprint library table: list of footprint libraries available in the board editor."
msgstr "封装库表：电路板编辑器中可用的封装库列表。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "`fp-info-cache`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Cache to speed up loading of footprint libraries. Does not need to be\n"
"      distributed with the project or put under version control."
msgstr "缓存以加快封装库的加载速度。无需随工程一起分发或置于版本控制之下。"

#. type: Title ====
#: kicad.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common files"
msgstr "通用文件"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_prl`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Local settings for the current project; helps KiCad remember\n"
"the last used settings such as layer visibility or selection filter.\n"
"Does not need to be distributed with the project or put under version control."
msgstr "当前工程的本地设置；帮助 KiCad 记住上次使用的设置，例如图层可见性或选择过滤器。无需与工程一起分发或放入版本控制。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_wks`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page layout (drawing border and title block) description file."
msgstr "页面布局（绘制图框和标题块）描述文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.kicad_jobset`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobset definition file containing output jobsets."
msgstr "包含输出作业集的作业集定义文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:139 kicad.adoc:401
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.net`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Netlist file created from the schematic, and read by the board editor.\n"
"Note that the\n"
"xref:../pcbnew/pcbnew.adoc#forward-and-back-annotation[recommended\n"
"workflow for transferring information from the schematic to the board] does not\n"
"require the use of netlist files."
msgstr "从原理图创建的网表文件，由电路板编辑器读取。请注意，xref:../pcbnew/pcbnew.adoc#forward-and-back-annotation[从原理图向电路板传输信息的推荐工作流程] 不需要使用网表文件。"

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "`*.cmp`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: kicad.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Association between components used in the schematic and their footprints.\n"
"It can be created by the Board Editor and imported by the Schematic Editor.\n"
"Its purpose is to import changes from the board to the schematic, for users\n"
"who change footprints in the Board Editor (for instance using **Exchange\n"
"Footprints** command) and want to import these changes back to the schematic.\n"
"Note that the\n"
"xref:../pcbnew/pcbnew.adoc#forward-and-back-annotation[recommended\n"
"workflow for transferring information from the board to the schematic] does not\n"
"require the use of `.cmp` files."
msgstr "原理图中使用的元件与其封装之间的关联。它可以由电路板编辑器创建，并由原理图编辑器导入。其目的是将更改从电路板导入到原理图，适用于在电路板编辑器中更改封装（例如使用 **更改封装** 命令）并希望将这些更改导入回原理图的用户。请注意，xref:../pcbnew/pcbnew.adoc#forward-and-back-annotation[将信息从电路板传输到原理图的推荐工作流程] 不需要使用 `.cmp` 文件。"

